e partial derivative at the point $(0,-1,1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂z}{|}_{(0,-1,1)} & =2(1){e}^{(0)(-1)}-(-1)^{3}{e}^{(-1)(1)} \\\\  & =2+{e}^{-1}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
